commit ff0bfcb955ec8cefef944454e72567e2bdc16ece

C03: the Spanish click retry hint steers to verbs the model conjugates (UI1377)

UI1373 measured H0555 «en la calculadora apretá el 5»: the click-verb check rejected «Apague el 5» and the corrected drafts read «Aprié el botón 5», a conjugation of «apretar» the model cannot produce for this request, so the turn ended without a response while «Pulsé el 7» and «Apreté el botón siete» passed.

llm hint missing_click_verb (es): say it with «Hice clic en el …» or «Pulsé el …» and the label the person asked for, without conjugating «apretar». The model still composes the sentence; no fixed reply.

No .NET change. Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


